<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2604586574"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1767334417"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="未完成ランデヴー"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lezel"/><amll:meta key="album" value="未完成ランデヴー"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:56.502"><div begin="00:01.194" end="02:35.943"><p begin="00:01.194" end="00:03.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">未完成なままでいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实无需去力求完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ka n se i na ma ma de i i no</span></p><p begin="00:04.541" end="00:06.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">エンドロールはいらないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个故事并不需要片尾字幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e n do ro o ru ha i ra na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:08.866" end="00:11.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">誰にも言えない 私の声を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法对他人提及的心声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ni mo i e na i wa ta shi no ko e wo</span></p><p begin="00:12.963" end="00:15.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">貴方だけは 気づいたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就只有你一人察觉到了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta da ke ha ki du i ta no</span></p><p begin="00:30.717" end="00:33.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">あたたかい言の葉と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我寻获了温暖的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ta ka i ko to no ha to</span></p><p begin="00:34.481" end="00:37.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">花刺繍を見つけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那些花朵刺绣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na shi shu u wo mi tsu ke ta</span></p><p begin="00:38.095" end="00:39.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ふわふわり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻轻盈盈 漂浮于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu wa fu wa ri u ka n da</span></p><p begin="00:40.226" end="00:43.174" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">浮かんだ君との思い出に<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to no o mo i de ni mi ta sa re te ku</span></p><p begin="00:44.374" end="00:45.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">満たされてく</p><p begin="00:46.773" end="00:47.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">鼓動が早くなってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随愈发加速的心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do u ga ha ya ku na 't te ku</span></p><p begin="00:48.874" end="00:50.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">もっとクラクラに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加令我头晕目眩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to ku ra ku ra ni</span></p><p begin="00:50.586" end="00:52.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">クラクラにさせてなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我感到头晕目眩吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ra ku ra ni sa se te na n te</span></p><p begin="00:53.485" end="00:55.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">望んでもいいのかな？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此希望也可以吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no zo n de mo i i no ka na ？</span></p><p begin="00:56.165" end="00:58.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">ずっと続いて欲しいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望一切能永远延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to tsu du i te ho shi i yo</span></p><p begin="00:59.429" end="01:02.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">君との甘すぎる夢の中で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你身处甜腻无比的梦里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to no a ma su gi ru yu me no na ka de</span></p><p begin="01:03.710" end="01:06.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">泳いでいる事も忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至忘却要徜徉其中了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o yo i de i ru ko to mo wa su re te</span></p><p begin="01:07.491" end="01:09.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">明日も会えるかなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天也可以与你相见吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta mo a e ru ka na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:10.222" end="01:12.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">私ちょっと 期待してるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对此稍微有一些期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi cho 't to ki ta i shi te ru no</span></p><p begin="01:13.903" end="01:17.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">小さな幸せを百数えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断细数琐碎的幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na shi a wa se wo hya ku ka zo e te</span></p><p begin="01:18.299" end="01:21.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">長い夜を越えてゆくから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">熬过这个漫漫长夜之后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga i yo ru wo ko e te yu ku ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:22.663" end="01:25.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">いつもの場所で 待ち合わせするの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在往常的那个地方等待相见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo no ba sho de ma chi a wa se su ru no</span></p><p begin="01:26.877" end="01:29.208" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">二人だけの ランデヴー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是属于你我的约会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri da ke no ra n de vu u</span></p><p begin="01:37.435" end="01:40.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">望むことも 願うこともまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中的希望以及心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no zo mu ko to mo ne ga u ko to mo</span></p><p begin="01:41.711" end="01:42.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">慣れないけど<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da na re na i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:44.501" end="01:45.384" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">君との日々に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是与你共度的每天却令我不由得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to no hi bi ni do u shi yo u mo na ku</span></p><p begin="01:46.162" end="01:47.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">どうしようもなく幸福を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">体会到了无比幸福的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u fu ku wo ka n ji cha 't ta ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:48.893" end="01:49.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">感じちゃったから</p><p begin="01:51.741" end="01:54.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">未体験をひとつふたつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未曾体验过的点点滴滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta i ke n wo hi to tsu fu ta tsu</span></p><p begin="01:55.305" end="01:57.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">積み重ねてく心の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全部都积累在我心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mi ka sa ne te ku ko ko ro no na ka</span></p><p begin="01:59.618" end="02:02.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">君がくれた 幸せをそっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你给予我的幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga ku re ta shi a wa se wo</span></p><p begin="02:03.682" end="02:04.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">抱きしめた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄地拥入了怀里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to da ki shi me ta</span></p><p begin="02:05.731" end="02:08.628" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">このまま未完成なままでいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">维持原状就好 无需去力求完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma mi ka n se i na ma ma de i i no</span></p><p begin="02:09.843" end="02:12.875" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">エンドロールはいらないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个故事并不需要片尾字幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e n do ro o ru ha i ra na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:14.107" end="02:17.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">壊れた時計は魔法をかけても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便对损坏的时钟施下魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa re ta to ke i ha ma ho u wo ka ke te mo</span></p><p begin="02:17.971" end="02:19.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">もう動かないわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它也不再运转了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u u go ka na i wa</span></p><p begin="02:20.419" end="02:23.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">君との甘すぎる夢の中で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你身处甜腻无比的梦里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to no a ma su gi ru yu me no na ka de</span></p><p begin="02:24.853" end="02:27.583" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">泳いでいる事も忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至忘却要徜徉其中了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o yo i de i ru ko to mo wa su re te</span></p><p begin="02:29.064" end="02:31.879" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">誰も知らない この物語は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而这个无人知晓的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo shi ra na i ko no mo no ga ta ri ha</span></p><p begin="02:33.261" end="02:35.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">二人だけの ランデヴー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是属于你我的约会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri da ke no ra n de vu u</span></p></div></body></tt>